From: Simon Geljic <5978447+Geljic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:15:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Schema: PS2 layouts for textures, sounds, meshes, models,
 materials, sky

All conditional on ctx.platform() == 1, Xbox decoding is unchanged.
Verified with vcs2json --strict on every .gam/.map/.ls/.cin/.loc of the
PAL disc (710 files): every chunk ends exactly at its end offset.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
